WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.775
CFNIS Proxy Node.

00:00:02.725 --> 00:00:15.275
Data convergence across military whistleblower complaints and internal oversight records reveals the Canadian Forces National Investigation Service (CFNIS) functioning as a proxy buffer.

00:00:15.275 --> 00:00:25.937
This node serves primarily to stall, obfuscate, and artificially terminate investigations into high-ranking officers involved in procurement or doctrinal subversion.
